  "assessment": "SOURCE shows one street-level oblique view: a gridded tower stepping down toward a connected low left wing, planted terraces and recessed outdoor bays, a darker lower facade zone, and a right neighbor with punched windows and a vegetated end wall. Street tracks establish the foreground orientation. CURRENT preserves these principal landmarks, but source-visible recess depth, low-wing terrace configuration and neighboring window-row organization remain mismatched. Rear elevations, complete roof layouts and concealed connections are unobserved in SOURCE; no dimensions are confirmed. The supplied captures establish no definite slab penetration or floating rail.",
